# Classic 5 block blocks world
# Modified from the Soar Book
# John E. Laird
# University of Michigan
# 11/2/2019

# Soar version 9.6.5
# Updated 10/15/2026

# In this formulation, clear is computed as an elaboration
# (in elaborations/clear). The table is always clear

## Modified to work with ^world.

# should all be in agent-world
#production optimize-attribute above 10

# contains all of the rules required for simple lookahead, iterative deepending. 
# does not contain rules for the hierarchical implementation

pushd ../../default-world
source agent-world.soar -v
source simple.soar -v
#source selection-world.soar -v
#source selection-iterative-deepening.soar -v
popd

chunk only

chunk add-osk on
srand 1